WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone is about to start!

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.910
So this is a museum from the future...

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.170
I'm done hacking.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.380
Are you guys ready?

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:36.510
We're good.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:39.470
Okay then, start the mission!

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:28.940
They're planning to reform this place into practice grounds for the baseball club.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:29.790
No way...

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:32.640
We have to do something.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.720
Our surroundings don't look any different...

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:43.470
But everything involving soccer is disappearing.

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:46.900
That soccer ban sure drives me nuts.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:54.450
At this rate, soccer really will be forgotten and it will be harder for us to restore history.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:57.960
We have to beat Protocol Omega 2.0 soon.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:01.320
Yeah, as well as save Coach Endou.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.280
But we're still not strong enough...

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:09.540
Yeah, Tenma is the only one right now who can use Avatar Armed.

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:30.160
If all of us were able to use Avatar Armed, our team level would go up...

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:33.700
Except we can't practice out in the open.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:34.540
Yes.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:37.190
And we don't have enough people.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.750
We'll have to rely on the Dupli for now.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.740
We're putting a lot of burden on you, Fei.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.200
I'll be fine.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.310
Thanks, Fei.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.140
I know!

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:50.410
We can use the holy book of champions!

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:55.290
The holy book of champions?

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:59.630
It's a book that contains secrets on how to create the strongest soccer team in history!

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.570
The strongest soccer team in history?

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:04.690
That's pretty neat!

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:05.890
Wait a second!

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:12.100
The holy book of champions is an exhibit at the soccer museum 200 years from now.

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:14.380
200 years from now?

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:15.560
It's in the future?

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:24.340
But if that book is so amazing, wouldn't El Dorado have used it already to make their own team?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.640
That's true...

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:33.460
The holy book of champions is written in a code that is indecipherable.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.240
Doctor Aruno!

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:36.670
He appeared out of nowhere again!

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.300
Allow me to explain.

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:47.900
The holy book of champions was written by Master D, the most legendary player to ever be known in the future soccer world.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:49.260
Master D?

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:50.380
Yes.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:57.540
Long ago, all those who worshiped Master D fought each other to obtain the holy book of champions.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:03.380
Possessing the holy book could upset the balance of power in the soccer world.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:08.950
That is why Master D wrote the essential points of soccer in code.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:13.700
That means we can't read it either.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.290
Yeah...

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:16.920
Doctor, would you know how to decipher it?

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:18.770
...And he's gone.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:20.630
He pops in and out way too fast.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:23.530
Men!

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:26.090
We'll worry about whether we can read it or not later!

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.680
Now is the time for action!

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:34.930
If El Dorado's interference with time continues unperturbed, soccer will disappear from the world 200 years from now!

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:42.650
What's more, the physical manifestation of love for soccer as written by Master D will be no more!

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.650
The physical manifestation of love for soccer?

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:47.470
Yes!

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:49.910
No matter what, we must avoid that at all costs!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:54.580
We need the holy book of champions to protect everyone's feelings for soccer!

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:58.460
Protect everyone's feelings for soccer, huh?

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:00.880
It's worth a shot.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.250
Things are getting interesting.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.880
Let's go, Tenma!

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:06.220
Yeah!

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:09.050
Let's go get the holy book of champions!

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:17.590
5...

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:18.720
4...

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:19.640
3...

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:20.800
2...

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:21.480
1...

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.570
Time jump!

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:31.590
The future...

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.490
I wonder what sort of place it's like!

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.330
I bet it's amazing!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:39.460
C'mon girls, this isn't a field trip.

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:43.340
Hey, Fei!

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:45.930
How does the town look like 200 years from now?

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:48.860
Yeah, I want to know too!

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:51.130
This is our first time going to the future!

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:53.680
It's gotta be a super hi-tech city!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:57.500
I bet it has cars that can fly or travel through time!

00:06:57.700 --> 00:06:58.890
You'll see once you're there.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:01.710
C'mon, tell us!

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:03.930
What sort of place do you live in?

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.770
Do you have family or siblings?

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.120
So this is a museum from the future...

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:40.390
This is the soccer museum.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.100
The holy book of champions is in the third exhibition room.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:47.150
I will hack into the security system overlooking your points of entry...

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:51.150
...and guide you to the third exhibition room using the safest and quickest route.

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:57.370
We're counting on you, Wondeba...

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.120
I'm done hacking.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.010
Here it is.

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:23.490
Let's go, everyone.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:40.290
That's it! Now turn left there.

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:41.620
Okay.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:57.340
Turn the next corner and open the door further in.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:06.020
Huh? It won't open.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.520
Wait, it looks like the security code here is different.

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.230
This is tricky...

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:15.000
How about this? Try it.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.650
No good.

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:21.190
Oh no...

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:23.250
Wondeba, is there another way in?

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:25.300
In a way, yes, but...

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:29.060
Huh? The ducts?

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:31.710
Analyzing the security code takes time that we're running out of.

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:33.880
We can't stand around waiting.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:34.460
Okay.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.800
Be very careful.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:38.340
Nishiki-senpai!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:39.510
Okay!

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.860
I hope they'll be okay...

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:50.400
You sure they'll reach that holy book whatnot in one piece?

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.050
Yeah...

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.360
But it'll be a bit of a tightrope...

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:14.530
There should be an emergency switch that opens it.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.590
Is this it?

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:21.930
It opened!

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.520
It's not connected here.

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:32.440
What's the meaning of this?

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:37.540
It's dangerous, but they'll just have to do their best!

00:10:46.070 --> 00:10:48.000
That's our only way of continuing on.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:51.630
We can't reach that...

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.380
We'll just have to try.

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:57.020
By working together...

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.230
Well, can you reach it?

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:28.310
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.500
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:37.500
Jump!

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:48.640
That was close...

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:51.400
Thank goodness...

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:53.420
My heart almost stopped!

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.950
As expected of Shinsuke's jumping ability.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.670
Those guys sure do crazy stuff.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:02.360
You're not allowed to comment!

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:12.090
I'm done analyzing the security code.

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:13.180
I'll send it to you now.

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:15.860
Roger.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:19.970
Please open...

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:35.600
They're security robots.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:39.210
They even have these around?

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:40.860
The third exhibition room is close by.

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:43.400
Walk carefully so they don't find us out.

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:52.430
The holy book of champions...

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.720
That has the secrets of the strongest team in history...

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:56.590
Okay.

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:58.600
I'm going to undo the guarding system.

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:01.760
The moment's here at last...

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:07.010
Almost done...

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:13.800
All right!

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.270
Hey.

00:13:17.090 --> 00:13:18.910
The sensors are on a different system?!

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.170
What's up with this?

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:23.530
I can't turn it off at all!

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.660
Hurry, the security robots are coming!

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:28.590
I know that, but this is too complicated!

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:30.030
We can't get close enough!

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:44.380
I can dodge that...

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:46.200
I'll go get it!

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:47.680
Tenma!

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:57.640
That could work!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.070
Okay!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.720
That's it, Tenma!

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:22.870
Let's go, guys!

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:23.630
We're out of here!

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:27.410
We have intruders.

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:29.130
They have taken the holy book of champions.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:30.800
What?

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:37.520
Not even El Dorado's finest research facilities could decipher the code written in that book.

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:41.480
There's not a chance it can be read even if they have taken it.

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:57.370
Wondeba, we have the book, but there are security robots everywhere, so we can't move around freely.

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:01.420
You'll have to find your own way out!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.240
I wish you luck!

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:06.670
That's easy to say...

00:15:17.050 --> 00:15:18.680
They have us pincered.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:19.890
Charge through them!

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:32.660
All right!

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.790
Chairman, we've identified the intruders.

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:38.770
So it is them.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:43.990
Could they know a way to decipher that code?

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:46.790
Don't let them escape.

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:50.670
It looks like there's only one escape route remaining.

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.090
Which way do we go?

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:56.900
Keep running down that passage.

00:15:56.900 --> 00:16:00.930
But there's one place you can't avoid if you want to leave from there...

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:00.930
Fei, hurry!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:01.930
Okay!

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:02.940
In any case, we're going.

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:12.760
Okay.

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.280
Now it won't open.

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:17.500
What is this place?

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:27.840
I can't get over there!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.050
We're locked in!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:31.460
What's that?!

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:53.450
Welcome to the soccer battle simulation room.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.310
Soccer battle?

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:57.470
It said it was a simulation room.

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:59.010
That means...

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:02.160
We have to play soccer with these robots?

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:04.640
Wondeba, what's going on?

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:06.280
I didn't have time to tell you!

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:09.300
If you want to leave from there, you have to score a point and win.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.090
No way!

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:14.590
We'll just have to do it.

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:15.530
Yes.

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:18.510
Guys...

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:28.320
Game start.

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:32.530
Nishiki!

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:33.810
Okay!

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.820
I won't lose to robots!

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:49.920
Nishiki-senpai!

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.280
Are you okay?

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:56.800
Yeah...

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.220
That was downright nasty!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:04.720
Tenma!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.150
They can even do that?

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.350
Will they be okay?

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:18.820
These robots are pretty tough.

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:34.100
Everyone's tired out.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.160
We have to score a point somehow.

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:37.170
Yes!

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:49.060
Okay, now!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.190
Go, Tenma!

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:52.690
Tenma, make it in!

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:55.730
Okay!

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.240
I'll make this point no matter what!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.080
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:15.750
Armed!

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:33.810
Here I go!

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.160
Awesome, Tenma!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:02.400
Game over.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:04.140
Game over.

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:07.170
Yes, we won!

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:08.140
You got it in.

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:09.920
Yeah!

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:15.030
Avatar Armed sure is amazing!

00:20:15.030 --> 00:20:17.150
You've got a complete mastery over it.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:18.570
Yes!

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:24.910
C'mon, let's get back to the caravan!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:25.890
Okay!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:32.870
Guys, hurry and get in!

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:40.960
5...

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:41.960
4...

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:42.970
3...

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:43.930
2...

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:44.970
1...

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.220
Time jump!

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:51.300
I'm sorry, sir.

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:52.830
They've time jumped.

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:57.100
Bring it back.

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:03.820
Now, this is where things get rough.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:05.450
I wonder what's written in it.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:10.460
If he went so far to preserve it that he wrote it in code, it's gotta be because he wanted someone to read it.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:13.200
So we should be able to decipher it.

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:16.350
It's okay.

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:17.750
Things will work out somehow!

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:21.190
We'll do it!

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:25.490
We'll decipher the holy book of champions and make the strongest team ever!

00:22:53.750 --> 00:22:57.680
Following the secrets of the holy book, we travel through time again!

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.130
The story takes on a new development!

00:23:00.130 --> 00:23:03.690
Next, A Shocking Reunion! Endou Daisuke!!

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:05.760
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:19.040
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:23.390 --> 00:23:26.990
We'll worry about it later, now is the time for action!

00:23:26.990 --> 00:23:27.670
That's all!
